  "description": "This time, it's my turn to save you. \n\nAfter being freed from a painful existence with the help of her ex-fiancé Prince Vicente, Elena wakes up inside the body of Evelyn, an orphan girl. 2 years later, Elena discovers that Vicente has been locked up in a palace for her death. With this, she who was once saved now seeks to be the savior. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
